From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wmvcore: Implement WMValidateData and WMIsAvailableOffline.

WMValidateData checks that a buffer starts with an ASF header object;
WMIsAvailableOffline reports local files and URLs as available.
---
